                    },
                    "doc_index": 350,
                    "source_id": "Index_350",
                    "source_domain": "Unknown"
                },
                "I studied the proofs attentively.": {
                    "text_span": {
                        "start": 3616,
                        "end": 3716
                    },
                    "doc_index": 434,
                    "source_id": "Index_434",
                    "source_domain": "Unknown"
                },
                "I get annoyed when my husband switches the news channel too much.": {
                    "text_span": {
                        "start": 3584,
                        "end": 3684
                    },
                    "doc_index": 113,
                    "source_id": "Index_113",
                    "source_domain": "Unknown"
                },
                "Witnessed murder and horror upon arrival.": {
                    "text_span": {
                        "start": 700,
                        "end": 800
                    },
                    "doc_index": 190,
                    "source_id": "Index_190",
                    "source_domain": "Unknown"
                },
                "I was the only one who put the anthology together.": {
                    "text_span": {
                        "start": 125,
                        "end": 225
                    },
                    "doc_index": 140,
                    "source_id": "Index_140",
                    "source_domain": "Unknown"
                },
                "My opinion is not God's law.": {
                    "text_span": {
                        "start": 3556,
                        "end": 3656
                    },
                    "doc_index": 307,
                    "source_id": "Index_307",
                    "source_domain": "Unknown"
                },
                "I was with a woman who was nearly crushed.": {
                    "method": "manipulation",
                    "location": "north and south",
                    "text_span": {
                        "start": 525,
                        "end": 625
                    },
                    "doc_index": 307,
                    "source_id": "Index_307",
                    "source_domain": "Unknown"
                },
                "The speaker's husband keeps telling them to go back to college.": {
                    "text_span": {
                        "start": 2635,
                        "end": 2735
                    },
                    "doc_index": 398,
                    "source_id": "Index_398",
                    "source_domain": "Unknown"
                },
                "I thought it would be fun to write my own.": {
                    "text_span": {
                        "start": 1512,
                        "end": 1612
                    },
                    "doc_index": 217,
                    "source_id": "Index_217",
                    "source_domain": "Unknown"
                },
                "I agree with you that they excoriate Reed.": {
                    "text_span": {
                        "start": 1197,
                        "end": 1297
                    },
                    "doc_index": 297,
                    "source_id": "Index_297",
                    "source_domain": "Unknown"
                },
                "The car is moving, and there is a need to stop it.": {
                    "text_span": {
                        "start": 2975,
                        "end": 3031
                    },
                    "doc_index": 296,
                    "source_id": "Index_296",
                    "source_domain": "Unknown"
                },
                "I couldn't imagine locking him up but fantasized about putting him in a home.": {
                    "text_span": {
                        "start": 3268,
                        "end": 3368
                    },
                    "doc_index": 12,
                    "source_id": "Index_12",
                    "source_domain": "Unknown"
                },
                "I have seen many episodes and thought it would be amusing to write an episode set in a think tank.": {
                    "text_span": {
                        "start": 1323,
                        "end": 1423
                    },
                    "doc_index": 217,
                    "source_id": "Index_217",
                    "source_domain": "Unknown"
                },
                "I find myself live on the air.": {
